<% const counts=after_hours_counts(); %>
<section class="after-page lounge-page" data-lounge>
  <noscript><p class="community-empty">小屋里的互动需要 JavaScript；你仍可通过导航阅读文章和个人页。</p></noscript>
  <header class="lounge-banner"><img src="<%= url_for(theme.nijika.lounge_art || theme.nijika.aftershow || theme.nijika.cover) %>" alt="演出后台的鼓、录音机与票根插画"><div><span class="after-eyebrow">CC ATELIER / AFTER HOURS</span><h1 tabindex="-1">散场后，<br>再待一会儿。</h1><p>这里有一点声音，也有一点小惊喜。</p></div><span class="lounge-banner-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></header>
  <nav class="lounge-tabs" aria-label="后台小屋区域"><a href="#reading-shelf">听点文字</a><a href="#ticket-desk">入场纪念</a><a href="#sound-desk">声音实验</a><a href="<%= url_for('guestbook/') %>">留言板 ↗</a></nav>
  <div class="lounge-grid">
    <section class="lounge-card discovery-card" id="reading-shelf"><span class="after-eyebrow">01 / SHUFFLE THE SETLIST</span><h2>下一首，<br>是哪一篇？</h2><p>把选择交给一点偶然。</p><div class="shuffle-disc" aria-hidden="true"><span>cc.</span></div><div class="shuffle-actions"><button data-random-post="writing">随便读一篇 <span>↗</span></button><button data-random-post="hot100">抽一道 Hot100 <span>↗</span></button></div><span class="lounge-fine-print"><%= counts.writing %> 篇手记 · <%= counts.series %> 道练习</span></section>
    <section class="lounge-card collection-card"><span class="after-eyebrow">02 / YOUR PRIVATE SETLIST</span><div class="collection-title"><h2>你的阅读歌单</h2><span data-saved-count>00</span></div><div class="reading-list-tabs" role="group" aria-label="选择阅读列表"><button data-reading-list-tab="saved" aria-pressed="true">已收藏</button><button data-reading-list-tab="recent" aria-pressed="false">最近读过</button></div><div data-reading-list><p class="community-empty">在文章下方点「收进歌单」，留待下次。</p></div><span class="lounge-fine-print">仅保存在这台浏览器。</span></section>
    <section class="lounge-card passport-card" id="ticket-desk"><span class="after-eyebrow">03 / KEEP YOUR TICKET</span><h2>这一趟，留张票。</h2><div class="visitor-pass"><div><span>CC ATELIER / BACKSTAGE PASS</span><strong>ADMIT<br>ONE<span>✦</span></strong></div><span class="visitor-pass-id" data-pass-id>—</span><div class="passport-stamps" aria-label="你的到访印章"><% for(const [key,label] of [['atelier','入场'],['notes','听读'],['about','相识'],['guestbook','回声'],['lounge','安可']]) { %><span data-pass-stamp="<%= key %>"><i aria-hidden="true">✦</i><%= label %></span><% } %></div><span class="visitor-pass-date" data-pass-date></span></div><button class="after-text-button" data-download-ticket>带走这张纪念票 ↓</button><span class="lounge-fine-print">走过不同栏目，会留下各自的印章。仅记录在本机。</span></section>
    <section class="lounge-card encore-note-card"><span class="after-eyebrow">04 / A LITTLE ENCORE</span><div class="daily-note"><span data-daily-date></span><strong data-daily-note>给今天，留一点热爱。</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i><span>CC ATELIER / 每日小签</span></div><p>一句写给今天的话。</p><button class="after-text-button" data-copy-note>把这句话带走 ↗</button></section>
    <section class="lounge-card sound-card" id="sound-desk"><span class="after-eyebrow">05 / SOUND CHECK</span><h2>轮到你，打下一拍。</h2><div class="sound-object" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sound-cymbal"></span><span class="sound-drum">N<span>✦</span></span><i></i><b></b></div><p>底鼓、军鼓、踩镲。拼一段自己的节奏。</p><button class="after-solid-button rhythm-open">打开节奏台 <span>↗</span></button><span class="lounge-fine-print">点击后才会发声，关闭即停止。</span></section>
    <section class="lounge-card focus-card"><span class="after-eyebrow">06 / ONE QUIET SESSION</span><div class="focus-amp"><div class="amp-brand">CC / PRACTICE AMP <span aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span></div><div class="focus-duration" role="group" aria-label="选择专注时长"><button data-focus-minutes="25" aria-pressed="true">25 分钟</button><button data-focus-minutes="5" aria-pressed="false">5 分钟休息</button></div><output data-focus-time aria-label="剩余时间" aria-live="off">25:00</output><div class="focus-buttons"><button data-focus-start>开始专注</button><button data-focus-reset>重置</button></div><p data-focus-status role="status">给一件小事，一段完整的时间。</p></div><span class="lounge-fine-print">计时保留在本机；到时以画面提示，不自动响铃。</span></section>
    <section class="lounge-card light-card"><span class="after-eyebrow">07 / LIGHTING DESK</span><h2>今晚，开什么灯？</h2><div class="light-presets" role="group" aria-label="舞台灯光"><button data-stage-light="amber" aria-pressed="true"><i></i>暖金</button><button data-stage-light="rose" aria-pressed="false"><i></i>暮红</button><button data-stage-light="moon" aria-pressed="false"><i></i>月蓝</button></div><div class="charm-desk"><button class="triangle-charm" data-charm aria-label="碰一下虹夏的小三角挂件"><span></span></button><p data-charm-note role="status">轻轻碰一下，摇出一点好心情。</p></div><span class="lounge-fine-print">灯光只改变舞台氛围，文章阅读模式保持独立。</span></section>
    <section class="lounge-card audience-card"><span class="after-eyebrow">08 / THE AUDIENCE</span><h2>有人来，就有回声。</h2><div class="audience-numbers"><div><strong data-stat="visitors">—</strong><span>来访浏览器</span></div><div><strong data-stat="views">—</strong><span>页面到访</span></div></div><small data-stats-context>正在打开入场记录……</small><a href="<%= url_for('guestbook/') %>">留下你的回声 ↗</a><div class="after-links"><a href="<%= url_for('atom.xml') %>">RSS 订阅 ↗</a><button data-help-open>操作小抄 ?</button></div></section>
  </div>
</section>
